OL,3,ADeeply divided Israel braces for
OL,4,Apivotal election
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Saturday night, vast crowds of
OL,7,Fopposition voters gathered in central
OL,8,FTel Aviv to demand a change of
OL,9,Fgovernment.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
